{
"#name"
:
{
"zh"
:
"为 ffmpeg 设计的增强模块"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced modules for ffmpeg"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"ffmpeg 是用于处理音频、视频、字幕和相关元数据等多媒体内容的库和工具的集合。\n若当前环境没有安装 ffmpeg，将使用 pixi 模块快速安装并以不影响当前环境的方式调用 ffmpeg。\n关于 pixi，请访问 https://prefix.dev/ 或者 'x pixi --help'。\n"
,
"en"
:
"ffmpeg is a collection of libraries and tools for working with multimedia content such as audio, video, subtitles, and related metadata.\nIf ffmpeg is not currently installed in your environment, the pixi module will quickly install it and invoke ffmpeg in a way that won't disrupt your current setup.\nFor information about pixi, please visit https://prefix.dev/ or run 'x pixi --help'.\n"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff mpeg -i test.mp4 test.avi"
,
"zh"
:
"将视频从 mp4 格式转换为 avi 格式"
,
"en"
:
"Converts video from mp4 format to avi format"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff probe -show_streams test.mp4"
,
"zh"
:
"显示 test.mp4 的所有可用流信息"
,
"en"
:
"Display all available stream info for test.mp4"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff play -nodisp test.mp4"
,
"zh"
:
"播放媒体文件中的音频"
,
"en"
:
"Play audio from a media file"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff rec -f meeting.wav"
,
"zh"
:
"录制音频到 meeting.wav"
,
"en"
:
"Record audio to meeting.wav"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff tr meeting.wav -o transcript.txt"
,
"zh"
:
"将音频转写为文本"
,
"en"
:
"Transcribe audio to text"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ff livetr -f meeting.wav --reasoning-file agent.md"
,
"zh"
:
"实时转写并启用 Agent 辅助"
,
"en"
:
"Live transcription with AI agent assistance"
}
]
,
"rec"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"录制音频"
,
"en"
:
"Record audio from microphone"
}
,
"#arg"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
""
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"音频输出文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Output audio file path"
}
}
]
,
"-f"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定输出文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Specify output file path"
}
}
,
"-d"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定音频设备 (默认: :0)"
,
"en"
:
"Specify audio device (default: :0)"
}
}
,
"-r"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"采样率 (默认: 16000)"
,
"en"
:
"Sample rate (default: 16000)"
}
}
,
"-c"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"声道数 (默认: 1)"
,
"en"
:
"Number of channels (default: 1)"
}
}
}
,
"tr"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"转写音频为文本 (使用 Whisper)"
,
"en"
:
"Transcribe audio to text (using Whisper)"
}
,
"#arg"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
""
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"输入音频文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Input audio file path"
}
}
]
,
"-i"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定输入文件"
,
"en"
:
"Specify input file"
}
}
,
"-o"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定输出文件"
,
"en"
:
"Specify output file"
}
}
,
"-m"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"Whisper 模型 (tiny/base/small/medium/large, 默认: base)"
,
"en"
:
"Whisper model (tiny/base/small/medium/large, default: base)"
}
}
,
"-l"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"语言代码 (如 zh/en/ja, 默认: auto)"
,
"en"
:
"Language code (e.g. zh/en/ja, default: auto)"
}
}
,
"-f"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"输出格式 (txt/srt/vtt/json, 默认: txt)"
,
"en"
:
"Output format (txt/srt/vtt/json, default: txt)"
}
}
,
"-p"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"提示词 (用于提高转写质量)"
,
"en"
:
"Prompt (for better transcription quality)"
}
}
}
,
"livetr"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"实时转写 (双轨制：实时快转 + 完整存档)"
,
"en"
:
"Live transcription (dual-track: real-time + archive)"
}
,
"#arg"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
""
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"输出音频文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Output audio file path"
}
}
]
,
"-f"
:
{
"#desc"
:
